OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny mist or fog patches will
OL,6,Fgradually clear in the morning,
OL,7,Ffollowed by a fine and dry day with
OL,8,Flong spells of sunshine, turning hazy
OL,9,Fat times. Staying dry for most, but
OL,10,Fblustery showers continue in northwest
OL,11,FScotland.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry at first and turning
OL,14,Fchilly under clear skies. Rain quickly
OL,15,Fmoves into southeast England, turning
OL,16,Fheavy at times. Largely cloudy across
OL,17,Fthe south by the end of the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
