OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudy morning with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of drizzle at first. Turning
OL,7,Fincreasingly windy with gales in the
OL,8,Fnorthwest, and rather warm in the
OL,9,Feast. Heavy rain arrives in the west
OL,10,Flater.
